    ],
    "text": "PART III - LANDS FINAL ORDERS LAND SETTLEMENT DEPARTMENT Settlement Orders No. 22 (Jaffna) Whereas a settlement notice under Section 4 of the Land Settlement Ordinance was duly published in the Gazette No. 14872 of 19th September, 1969, and as otherwise required by the said Section, in respect of the lands situated in the village of Periyakulam in Kanda-valai village Headman\u2019s (Now Grama Sewaka\u2019s) Division in Karachchi-Tunukkai (Now Karachchi) D.R.O.\u2019s Division (Now Kanda-valai Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division) of the Jaffna District in the Nothern Province and described as Lot nos. inset 05 47, 48, 49, 50, 51, inset 06 53, inset 07 55 and 56 in Block Survey Topo Plan No. 21 (North) (Vide Settlement Notice No. 4049 (Jaffna)). And whereas all claims received in pursuance of the said notice have been duly dealt with in accordance with the provisions of the said Ordinance: I, the undersigned, in pursuance of the powers conferred on me by Section 5(5) of the said Ordinance do hereby make order that the lands or portions thereof be settled as specified in the Schedule to this order. D.M.M. DISSANAYAKA, Assistant Settlement Officer Commissioner of - Land Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, Battaramulla 05th September, 2016. SCHEDULE Remarks Sub (shares, Land No. of Section interests, Register Sub Extent Title under On whom settled encumbrances office at Volume Folio Lot Divisional A. R. P. Pan which Nos. of which No. No. No. No. settled Reference, registered",
